  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"通过输入客户ID、关键词、行为场景和行为天数等参数，查询行为兴趣定向的行为关键词。需配合【获取Access-Token】接口获取授权，行为场景和行为天数的详细信息可参考对应附录文档。\",\"id\":\"ad.interest_action_keyword.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/interest_action/action/keyword/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1697466916182083\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access-Token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1697466916182083\",\"title\":\"行为关键词查询\"}",
